title: Act3_Judge_N0
---
/// no repeat
<<set_portrait YarnManager Judge oh>>
The Judge: Killed by a human this time? That’s new.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus disgust>>
Cyrus: Is this just entertainment to you?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Judge pout>>
The Judge: I work all day long! Don’t blame me for finding joy in the little things.
The Judge: Who knows how long I’ll have to watch you run in circles before you kill the other False Human.  

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus angrySpeak>>
Cyrus: Why did that woman kill me? It looked like she recognized-

<<set_portrait YarnManager Judge confused>>
The Judge: YOU’RE the one who threw away your memories, don’t ask me! Just keep your head down and focus on saving Prism. Meeting adjourned!

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus eyesclosed>>
Cyrus: [i]...Of course I wasn’t going to get any answers.[/i]

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus angry>>
Cyrus: [i]But I’d better avoid that Luna woman then. She thought I was a False Human. Maybe she’s one of those “Arcana minions” that the Judge mentioned?[/i]

<<player_respawn YarnManager>>
===


title: Act3_FalseHumanInvestigation_N4
---
/// no repeat
<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve shock>>
Eve: You actually did it. Are you a Hunter?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus default>>
Cyrus: I’ve been waiting for the right dispatcher.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve oh>>
Eve: Are you a mind reader?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus smile>>
Cyrus: Maybe. I think we’d make a pretty good team.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve happyTalk>>
Eve: Huh, I was thinking the same... 

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve oh>>
Eve: Oh! Saul! Tobias! Over here!

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: Hey, Eve! And, uh, new guy. Don’t think I’ve seen you around before.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve default>>
Eve: Cyrus. He’s a Hunter-in-training. I’m going to be his dispatcher.
 
<<set_portrait YarnManager Tobias>>
Tobias: He needs better equipment. You know memory monsters have been spreading like wildfire through the outskirts lately.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve defaultTalk>>
Eve: Yeah, yeah, we’re headed to the shop.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus smug>>
Cyrus: Besides, I can handle myself just fine.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: Oooh! An arrogant one, huh? Hey kid, let me give you some real Hunting training.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve shock>>
Eve: For real?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: Yep! I’m intrigued now.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve angry>>
Eve: I’ll head back first then. You know my dad.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus surprisedQuestionmark>>
Cyrus: Will you be okay on your own?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve default>>
Eve: Of course! Got my trusty radio. We’re not even that far from town. Saul, you better bring him back to the shop in one piece.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: Yeah, of course! Don’t you trust me, Eve?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Tobias>>
Tobias: We need to get this job over with, Saul. The Ministry’s started docking pay if you’re late.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus surprisedSpeak>>
Cyrus: The MPS commissions Hunters?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Tobias>>
Tobias: Only when they need a live Meminiscor. They never tell us why, though. Government secrets.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: Don’t lie to him, Tobias. If he’s going to be a hunter, he should know.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus surprisedQuestionmark>>
Cyrus: Know what?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: MPS likes to keep things under wraps, but word is they use live monsters for False Human trials.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Tobias>>
Tobias: It isn’t wise to believe every rumor you hear.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: False Humans are the most evolved tier of memory monsters, right? And have you ever seen two monsters fighting each other on the outskirts?
Saul: Nope, they only go after humans!
Saul: I’d bet the MPS chucks all their False Human suspects to the memory monsters. That’s the only way to know for sure.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus surprisedSpeak>>
Cyrus: And what if their suspicions are wrong?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: It’s a risk you’ve gotta take.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus angrySpeak>>
Cyrus: How are we protecting humanity if we’re putting innocent people at risk?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: I mean, what’s the alternative? Let False Humans run free- start the Assimilation whenever they feel like it?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Tobias>>
Tobias: Ahem- Ignore Saul, this isn’t the first rabbit hole he’s been down. MPS probably just wants a live specimen for research.
Tobias: You better catch up with Eve; it’s not safe out here.

<<clear_portrait YarnManager>>
<<clear_cg YarnManager fadeWithBlack>>

: [i]Cyrus follows Eve’s path.[/i]

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockSad>>
Cyrus: [i]Wait...last loop, weren’t we ambushed by memory monsters on this path?[/i]
Cyrus: [i] ...Eve![/i]
===


title: Act3_EveCheckIn_N5
---
/// no repeat
<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockSad>>
Cyrus: Eve! Are you alright?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve confused>>
Eve: Why wouldn’t I be?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus surprisedQuestionmark>>
Cyrus: Did the monsters not attack?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve nervous>>
Eve: Uh...I saw a few. But I know how to avoid them, don’t worry.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus surprised>>
Cyrus: [i]I swear there were monsters on this path last time.[/i]
<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus surprisedSpeak>>
Cyrus: You’re sure you-

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve angry>>
Eve: I’m fine, Cyrus, Let’s keep moving.
===


