title: Act3_EveReveal_N9
---
/// no repeat
<<set_portrait YarnManager FateExchanger>>
Fate Exchanger: You seem heavy with thoughts, Justice’s slave.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus lookAway>>
Cyrus: You could say that. 

<<set_portrait YarnManager FateExchanger>>
Fate Exchanger:  You have your suspicions, don’t you? Perhaps I can help illuminate them.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus angrySpeak>>
Cyrus: What is this?

<<set_portrait YarnManager FateExchanger>>
Fate Exchanger: A Death Fate, from a girl I found on the outskirts.

<<clear_portrait YarnManager>>
<<clear_cg YarnManager fadeWithBlack>>

: [i]The Fate Exchanger hobbles into a clearing and comes across Ava, who is bleeding out in the grass. Beside her is a tree, with cut rope lying at the roots.[/i] - show memory (TODO)

<<set_portrait YarnManager Ava>>
Ava: Help...please.

<<set_portrait YarnManager FateExchanger>>
Fate Exchanger: Your time is near, young one.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Ava>>
Ava: Eve...
Ava: Eve did this...
Ava: She’s one of them...

<<clear_cg YarnManager fadeWithBlack>>

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockSad>>
Cyrus: This...this isn’t real.
Cyrus: It can’t be.

<<set_portrait YarnManager FateExchanger>>
Fate Exchanger: I am but a spiritual follower. I cannot defy my path, nor indulge in trickery.
===


title: Act3_PreCombat_Boss
---
/// no repeat
<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve confused>>
Eve: Cyrus?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus sad>>
Cyrus: ...

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve confused>>
Eve: Is something wrong?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus sad>>
Cyrus: Eve, all this time we’ve spent in the outskirts, and I’ve never seen the monsters attack [i]you[/i].

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve disgust>>
Eve: ...What?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockSad>>
Cyrus: Be honest with me. Are you a False Human?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve nervous>>
Eve: I-I didn’t...Why would you think that?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockSad>>
Cyrus: Eve-

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve nervousSerious>>
Eve: There could be plenty of reasons why they didn't attack me! You're just- throwing accusations around!

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockSad>>
Cyrus: I’m not trying to-

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve disgust>>
Eve: I’m your dispatcher. I’ve been helping you. I’ve been trying to keep people safe.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus sad>>
Cyrus: Eve, I know what happened to your sister.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve nervousSerious>>
Eve: ...

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve sad>>
Eve: She...you don’t understand.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockSad>>
Cyrus: Then help me understand.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve eyeclosed>>
Eve: Cyrus, what does justice mean to you?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus>>
Cyrus: It means protecting the good in this world.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve defaultPossessed>>
Eve: Then why are you working against it?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus shockBleed>>
Cyrus: Urgh! You-!

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve happyPossessed>>
Eve: After the Assimilation, there will be no more discord or pain. Eve was created to bring this peace.
<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve happyPossessedTalk>>
Eve: Under the Hierophant, we will all be one.
===
